<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωρόφ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also a, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			1.97
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.424
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Antip.Sid.
		</span></i>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄροφος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the roof, dwelling under
				it, under cover, in a house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.640
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξα . . νηῷ κεῖται ὑπωρόφια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					143
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρμιγγες ὑ.</span> the harps
				<i>sounding in the hall,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.97
			</span></i>; parodied, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. φάλαγγες</span>
			(spiders) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1313
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δόμοι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωροφία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>), ἡ,
				<i>the woodwork of a tiled roof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).161
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				51
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωρυφία</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				42(1).102.42
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); <i>the space under the
			roof</i> or <i>canopy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπνώδεις ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					4.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
